OL,3,GNEWSAExtra funds for team reducing
OL,4,Aavoidable A&E visits
OL,5,
OL,6,FA team aiming to reduce non-emergency
OL,7,FA&E visits has secured more than
OL,8,F#600,000 in funding.
OL,10,FThe High Impact Use team (HIU) in
OL,11,FCambridgeshire and Peterborough helps
OL,12,Fresidents access the right support
OL,13,Fwhile minimising their visits to
OL,14,Fhospital.
OL,16,FCambridgeshire County Council, which
OL,17,Foperates the scheme, said HIU had cut
OL,18,Fvisits by at least 40%.
OL,20,FIt added that the #609,552 would see
OL,21,Fthe team continue its work in 2027-28.
